          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On May 4, 2008, around 10:45 PM, a driver observed for 5 minutes a dozen orange glowing orbs stationary in the sky. No particular noise was heard. Despite the limited information provided by the witness about this phenomenon, it is likely that this person observed flying lanterns. In fact, there have been numerous observations of this type made between May and July 2008 in the eastern part of France.",
